      "about_detail": {
        "intro": "Company Profile",
        "intro_text": "Sichuan Kinming Electronics Co., Ltd. was founded in 2011 (formerly Suining Haoersi Electronic Technology Co., Ltd.), integrating nearly two decades of industry expertise from Hong'an Xingsheng and Haoersi. Located in Suining National Economic and Technological Development Zone Electronic Circuit Industrial Park, we have over 400 employees, 30,000 m² standardized factory space and monthly capacity of 1 million sq ft.\n\nWe specialize in R&D, design, precision production and supporting services of double-sided and multilayer high-precision HDI and high-difficulty PCBs. Our products are widely used in computers, data communications, commercial aerospace, automotive electronics, consumer electronics, telecommunications, AI and related industries, exported to Europe, America, Japan, Korea and other markets, serving 200+ customers across 30+ regions. We hold IATF16949, ISO9001, ISO14001, UL, CQC and other certifications, with RoHS-compliant products.\n\nUpholding the business philosophy of \"Integrity, Innovation, Efficiency, Collaboration, Sharing\" and the value concept of \"Quality Service, Customer Satisfaction, Mutual Benefit, Sustainable Development\", we are committed to improving customer satisfaction and building a distinctive brand in the PCB industry.",
